# Copy this file to `.env` and paste your real REST Countries v5 API key.
# Get one for free at https://restcountries.com/sign-up
#
# The `EXPO_PUBLIC_` prefix makes the value available to the app at build
# time via `process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_RESTCOUNTRIES_KEY`. Because anything
# `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` is embedded in the JS bundle, treat the key as
# semi-public (i.e. fine for a free-tier client-only MVP; for production
# secret-grade keys, proxy the request server-side).
EXPO_PUBLIC_RESTCOUNTRIES_KEY=rc_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
